===Particle===
{{en-head|pcl}}

# {{lb|en|AAVE|dated}} {{cap|to}}; ({{ng|the particle for marking the following verb as an [[infinitive]]}}).
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1896|journal=McClure's magazine|page=270
|passage=Ugh—I’ll not be able '''for''' get up. Send for M’sieu le Curé—I’ll be goin’ '''for''' die for  sure.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=December 17, 1898|work=Forest and Stream |title=Mr. Owens' Experience|author=|volume=51|page=485|passage=[It was a] firs rate place '''for''' shoot a woodcocks, I tell you. {{…}} I say [it] wass no use '''for''' spen money. {{…}} An I say in "So wass I. I see lot of sy-pokes fly up an twist off like screw-cork an spit whistle, but I wass'nt able '''for''' get aim on him." }}

